  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "A model upgraded with a drone gets a Drone token beside it as a reminder; tokens never count as models. Each drone gives:\n\n- **Guardian Drone**: ranged attacks against the bearer's unit get -1 to the **[Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)**.\n- **Gun Drone**: the bearer has a twin pulse carbine (Range 20\", A 2, BS 5+, S 5, AP 0, D 1) with **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** and **[[TWIN-LINKED]](vsdata:weapon-ability/twin-linked)**.\n- **Marker Drone**: gives the bearer's unit **MARKERLIGHT**, and that unit can act as another unit's [Observer](vsdata:ability/tau-empire.for-the-greater-good) even in a turn it [Advanced](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move).\n- **Missile Drone**: the bearer has a missile pod (Range 30\", A 2, BS 5+, S 7, AP -1, D 2).\n- **Shield Drone**: the bearer's Wounds go up by 1.",
